// CalculateTokens sums per-API-call usage from token_count records at or
// after the given line offset. Sarvam re-emits token_count events whose
// total_token_usage repeats the previous event's total, so per-event
// last_token_usage cannot be summed — a real session roughly doubles its
// true usage that way. Instead the window's usage is the delta between the
// cumulative total_token_usage of the last event in the window and the
// total as of the offset, and an event counts as an API call only when its
// total advances.
